+"{STEEL_UNREAD_NOTE} {names} - it has no geometry the law can read, so a strike on it would pass unseen" = "{STEEL_UNREAD_NOTE} {names}——该对象没有规则可读取的几何，因此撞击它不会被发现"
+"{TABLE_UNJUDGED_NOTE}: the machine does not state all of the X, Y and Z travel, so the first traverse is judged against the stock and the fixtures only" = "{TABLE_UNJUDGED_NOTE}：机床未完整声明 X、Y、Z 轴行程，因此首次横越仅针对毛坯和夹具进行判定"
+"{TOP_STOCK_WARNING} the operation's top Z{top:.3} is below the stock top Z{remaining:.3} over its region - approach rapids may enter uncut stock; raise Top or face first" = "{TOP_STOCK_WARNING} 工序顶部 Z{top:.3} 低于其区域内毛坯顶部 Z{remaining:.3}——接近快移可能进入未切削的毛坯；请提高顶部高度或先铣平面"
+"{UNSTATED} - not limited" = "{UNSTATED}——无限制"
+"{WIRE_VERDICT} - judged by the 2.5D wire laws (kerf, threading, slug): {}" = "{WIRE_VERDICT}——经 2.5D 线切割规则判定（割缝、穿丝、废料）：{}"
+"{a} must be three finite numbers" = "{a} 必须为三个有限数值"
+"{bodies} closed solid(s) wound inward (negative volume) were turned outward: {turned} facet(s) reversed" = "{bodies} 个向内缠绕（负体积）的封闭实体已被翻转为朝外：{turned} 个面片已反转"
+"{cause} leaves mod vise '{name}''s {side} jaw {after:.3} mm off the stock - re-fit the pair to clamp it" = "{cause} 使 mod vise '{name}' 的 {side} 钳口距毛坯 {after:.3} mm——请重新拟合该对钳口以夹紧毛坯"
+"{cause} would put mod vise '{name}''s {side} jaw {:.3} mm into the stock - {hint}" = "{cause} 会使 mod vise '{name}' 的 {side} 钳口切入毛坯 {:.3} mm——{hint}"
+"{comp_name} compensation does not ride a 3+2 tilt - choose In computer" = "{comp_name} 补偿不支持 3+2 倾斜——请选择 In computer"
+"{comp_name} compensation does not ride an open contour - choose In computer" = "{comp_name} 补偿不支持开放轮廓——请选择 In computer"
