+"{desc} cannot be protected - 'Do not touch' protects faces or edge chains" = "{desc} 无法被保护——'禁止触碰' 保护面或边链"
+"{desc} is a sketch pick - 'Do not touch' protects model faces or edge chains, not DXF sketch chains" = "{desc} 是草图拾取——'禁止触碰' 保护模型面或边链，不保护 DXF 草图链"
+"{desc} is a sketch pick - 'Do not touch' protects model faces or edge chains, not DXF sketch chains or layers" = "{desc} 是草图拾取——'禁止触碰' 保护模型面或边链，不保护 DXF 草图链或图层"
