+"{kind} cuts deeper than a mark: the cutter stands more than {} {} under the part's surface (the mark budget: the lesser of Top - Bottom and the cutter radius) - cut shallower, raise Top to the surface the line lies on, or model the groove" = "{kind} 切削深度超过刻痕：刀具位于零件表面下方超过 {} {}（刻痕余量：Top - Bottom 与刀具半径中的较小值）——请减小切深、将 Top 提高到线条所在表面，或将该凹槽建模"
