+"{kind}: the bar the centre-cutting audit reads cannot be built: {e}" = "{kind}：中心切削检查所读取的棒料无法构建：{e}"
+"{kind}: the first rapid comes from the turret's index position (the top of the X and Z travel) to radius {r:.3} at Z{:.3}; the lathe post turns C to that point, then sends X and Z in one rapid, so the tool can pass every radius from {r:.3} out, from Z{:.3} up, on the live-tool station, and {what} {reach} - raise the clearance height, or move it clear of that band" = "{kind}：首次快移从刀塔分度位置（X 和 Z 行程的顶端）移至半径 {r:.3}、Z{:.3} 处；车床后处理先将 C 轴转至该点，再以一个快移同时送出 X 和 Z，因此在动力刀位上刀具可能经过从 {r:.3} 向外、从 Z{:.3} 向上的所有半径，且 {what} {reach}——请提高安全距离高度，或将其移出该区域"
