+"{kind}: the path needs a C rewind, but the machine file states a C travel but no C rate - a rewind would post at an uncapped feed; state the C axis's feed or rapid rate" = "{kind}：刀路需要 C 轴回绕，但机床文件声明了 C 轴行程却未声明 C 轴速率——回绕将以无上限进给输出；请声明 C 轴的进给或快移速率"
+"{kind}: the path turns C over {word_lo:.3}..{word_hi:.3} deg, past the machine's C travel {mach_lo:.3}..{mach_hi:.3}; unwinding C at links is proven for Rotary Contour only, so {kind} is refused where it would need a rewind" = "{kind}：刀路将 C 轴转过 {word_lo:.3}..{word_hi:.3} 度，超出机床 C 轴行程 {mach_lo:.3}..{mach_hi:.3}；在连接段展开 C 轴仅对 Rotary Contour 经过验证，因此需要回绕的 {kind} 将被拒绝"
