+"{label} is a point - a boundary needs faces or edge chains; pick those, or use the vertex as a height or origin reference" = "{label} 是点——边界需要面或边链；请拾取它们，或将该顶点用作高度或原点参考"
+"{label} is an open run - a {} cannot end mid-edge; select a closed chain - Ctrl+click the remaining edges, or Shift+click to take the whole loop" = "{label} 是开放段——{} 不能在边中途结束；请选择封闭链——按住 Ctrl 点击其余边，或按住 Shift 点击选取整个环"
+"{label} is an open run - {} machines a closed boundary; use a 2D Contour or close the pick into a chain" = "{label} 是开放段——{} 加工封闭边界；请使用 2D Contour 或将拾取闭合为链"
