+"{label} is an open sketch chain - {word} side compensation is not allowed on open chains; choose Side 'Auto' or pick closed chains" = "{label} 是开放草图链——开放链上不允许 {word} 侧补偿；请选择 Side 'Auto' 或拾取封闭链"
