+"{label} is not a slot outline: {why} - pick a closed line-arc slot loop (two parallel sides and two half-circle ends) or an open straight centerline" = "{label} 不是槽轮廓：{why}——请拾取封闭的直线-圆弧槽环（两条平行边和两个半圆端），或开放的直线中心线"
+"{label} is not a usable ring: {e}" = "{label} 不是可用的环：{e}"
