+"{label}: cuts to Z{:.3}, {:.3} mm into the spoilboard, past setup '{s}''s through-cut allowance of {:.3} mm (floor Z{:.3}) - raise the operation's bottom height or state a larger allowance" = "{label}：切削至 Z{:.3}，进入垫板 {:.3} mm，超过装夹 '{s}' 的切穿余量 {:.3} mm（底面 Z{:.3}）——请提高工序的底部高度或指定更大的余量"
+"{label}: needs review before posting ({}) - inspect the operation and mark it reviewed" = "{label}：后处理前需要复核（{}）——请检查该工序并标记为已复核"
+"{label}: origin must be finite" = "{label}：原点必须为有限值"
+"{label}: rapids across at Z{:.3}, below setup '{s}''s clamp plane Z{:.3} (sheet top plus {:.3} mm clamp clearance) - raise the operation's clearance and retract heights" = "{label}：在 Z{:.3} 处横向快移，低于装夹 '{s}' 的压紧平面 Z{:.3}（板材顶面加 {:.3} mm 压紧安全距离）——请提高工序的安全距离和退刀高度"
+"{label}: rotation is degenerate (zero norm)" = "{label}：旋转退化（零范数）"
+"{label}: rotation must be finite (check the angle inputs)" = "{label}：旋转必须为有限值（请检查角度输入）"
+"{label}: the check for bands of the stock narrower than the tool did not run ({e}) - look at the stock around the part" = "{label}：比刀具更窄的毛坯条带检查未运行（{e}）——请查看零件周围的毛坯"
+"{label}: the check for corners of the stock tighter than the tool did not run ({e}) - look at the stock corners around the part" = "{label}：比刀具更紧的毛坯角落检查未运行（{e}）——请查看零件周围的毛坯角落"
